20c. Calls for the NBRPs to be aligned with plans under the Energy Efficiency Directive1a as well as the national Social Climate Plans, in order to deliver a coordinated approach to decarbonising buildings in the most ambitious and inclusive manner; calls for the creation of a strong and inclusive enabling framework to ensure that energy renovation projects become more accessible and upscaled via the availability, among other resources, of technical assistance and advisory services, as well as instruments that can improve funding absorption;

---

1a Directive (EU) 2023/1791 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 13 September 2023 on energy efficiency and amending Regulation (EU) 2023/955 (OJ L 231, 20.9.2023, p. 1, ELI:[http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/1791/oj](http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2023/1791/oj)).
